{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1107","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Vasya and Endless Credits"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya wants to buy himself a nice new car. Unfortunately, he lacks some money. Currently he has exactly "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, the local bank has $$$n$$$ credit offers. Each offer can be described with three numbers $$$a_i$$$, $$$b_i$$$ and $$$k_i$$$. Offers are numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$. If Vasya takes the $$$i$$$-th offer, then the bank gives him $$$a_i$$$ burles at the beginning of the month and then Vasya pays bank $$$b_i$$$ burles at the end of each month for the next $$$k_i$$$ months (including the month he activated the offer). "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya can take the offers any order he wants"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each month Vasya can take no more than one credit offer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Also each credit offer can not be used more than once"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Several credits can be active at the same time. It implies that Vasya pays bank the sum of $$$b_i$$$ over all the $$$i$$$ of active credits at the end of each month."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya wants to buy a car in the middle of some month. He just takes all the money he currently has and buys the car of that exact price."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya don't really care what he'll have to pay the bank back after he buys a car. He just goes out of the country on his car so that the bank can't find him anymore."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"What is the maximum price that car can have?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 500$$$) — the number of credit offers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains three integers $$$a_i$$$, $$$b_i$$$ and $$$k_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i, b_i, k_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the maximum price of the car."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n10 9 2\n20 33 1\n30 115 1\n5 3 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n32\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n40 1 2\n1000 1100 5\n300 2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1337\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, the following sequence of offers taken is optimal: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The amount of burles Vasya has changes the following way: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"32"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-86"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ .... He takes the money he has in the middle of the second month ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"32"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" burles) and buys the car."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The negative amount of money means that Vasya has to pay the bank that amount of burles."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, the following sequence of offers taken is optimal: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The amount of burles Vasya has changes the following way: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"300"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"338"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1337"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"236"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-866"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\rightarrow$$$ .... "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1107F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1107/problem/F"}